 CI, Akhtar A (2015) The MSL complex: juggling RNA-protein interactions for dosage compensation and beyond. Curr Opin Genet Dev 31:1&#x2013;11. 10.1016/j.gde.2015.03.007</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1016/j.gde.2015.03.007</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">25900149</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Norio P (2006) DNA replication: the unbearable lightness of origins. EMBO Rep 7(8):779&#x2013;781. 10.1038/sj.embor.7400766</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1038/sj.embor.7400766</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC1525147</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">16880822</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Roos WP, Krumm A (2016) The multifaceted influence of histone deacetylases on DNA damage signalling and DNA repair. Nucleic Acids Res 44(21):10017&#x2013;10030. 10.1093/nar/gkw922</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1093/nar/gkw922</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC5137451</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">27738139</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Stasevich TJ, Hayashi-Takanaka Y, Sato Y et al (2014) Regulation of RNA polymerase II activation by histone acetylation in single living cells. Nature 516(7530):272&#x2013;275. 10.1038/nature13714</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1038/nature13714</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">25252976</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Baumann C, Zhang X, Zhu L et al (2021) Changes in chromatin accessibility landscape and histone H3 core acetylation during valproic acid-induced differentiation of embryonic stem cells. Epigenetics Chromatin 14(1):58. 10.1186/s13072-021-00432-5</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1186/s13072-021-00432-5</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC8711205</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">34955095</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Harris HK, Nakayama T, Lai J et al (2021) Disruption of RFX family transcription factors causes autism, attention-deficit/hyperactivity disorder, intellectual disability, and dysregulated behavior. Genet Med 23(6):1028&#x2013;1040. 10.1038/s41436-021-01114-z</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1038/s41436-021-01114-z</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC9472083</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">33658631</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Mukhtar T, Breda J, Grison A et al (2020) Tead transcription factors differentially regulate cortical development. Sci Rep 10(1):4625. 10.1038/s41598-020-61490-5</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1038/s41598-020-61490-5</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC7070074</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">32170161</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Mercurio S, Serra L, Pagin M et al (2022) Deconstructing Sox2 function in brain development and disease. Cells. 10.3390/cells11101604</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.3390/cells11101604</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC9139651</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">35626641</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Hsu LC, Nam S, Cui Y et al (2015) Lhx2 regulates the timing of beta-catenin-dependent cortical neurogenesis. Proc Natl Acad Sci U S A 112(39):12199&#x2013;12204. 10.1073/pnas.1507145112</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1073/pnas.1507145112</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC4593128</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">26371318</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Labudova O, Krapfenbauer K, Moenkemann H et al (1998) Decreased transcription factor junD in brains of patients with Down syndrome. Neurosci Lett 252(3):159&#x2013;162. 10.1016/s0304-3940(98)00569-2</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1016/s0304-3940(98)00569-2</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">9739985</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Pedini G, Buccar